      "intro": {
        "title": "自己紹介 — Self-Introduction",
        "explanation": "Learn to introduce yourself in Japanese. You'll learn essential words for talking about yourself, your job, and your interests — then read real Japanese sentences using these words.",
        "cultureNote": "In Japan, self-introductions (自己紹介, jikoshoukai) are extremely important. They follow a structured pattern: name → origin/affiliation → interest/hobby → closing phrase."
      },
