        {
          "id": "theme-si-ga-suki",
          "title": "Xが好きです (X ga suki desu)",
          "explanation": "が (ga) marks the subject of 好き (suki, 'liked/favourite'). Use this pattern to express what you like. The thing you like comes before が.",
